/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uss4Pu1rbesQ7kNvwGeag5H&_nc_oc=AdqWX1WoBKoHHCt_xOxgHle2X_Md2iFh3WXroN-8Ii769QJMzk8i1A687VtsLkNMq6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEnCvS-lPje8KxV39JmjOhO78Yw8aBp1nGj3jr-aPcFfA&oe=6A92BBB9"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GbMncroKlrgQ7kNvwE7gIYd&_nc_oc=AdooeExLh4sbzGzNEgImp42s_Sp-MxUQj3UAVv6aHlbGy-ueM1hCrIWnKsN9R4jwCtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEvbx0tK-5Ns1hbadAi_U2DSDKnad2DDQVYRRegvY59AA&oe=6A92CD43"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mGFlxB2NhssQ7kNvwHVZqKj&_nc_oc=Adoo_-7pEPaG33Q0DLJgFpa83h7T7Z3pXAvZZSbJ6pqzE3QY-18c2oRFZugGfJz8-us&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGSDMLk-wnQr2ikWM2UehNjfjuAU7klxwmHJ1D0McZJuA&oe=6A92C40E"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9c-e8hMmg5kQ7kNvwFETQcB&_nc_oc=Adosj3mvNajFIdWKQORydtxxllhXaWwR1T1AQyAPJouzK7Ye14rV7c8d9pwwxbSzu3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHsIN-vOKSq_G4wxkuxUtfDDR8LWPnAuLZ1h7w--nEoUQ&oe=6A92CC33"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JB81os1fKu4Q7kNvwHnZvyd&_nc_oc=Adpyu36Oe7dYDAGPU1c6Iwk1E45lgVf292w8uQ65sZ2ifLMYUOVloR-T9q8F6LtMl8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHszGTukFA1OMGbk2xMjfZEN5ZdQb4RGzvzVDWGdeP0Gw&oe=6A92C57B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":